  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: two new plugins for Caveman 1.3.0 content-aware pipeline. CavemanRouterPlugin: route_content (auto-detects type and applies best compressor), detect_content_type, compress_json (SmartCrusher with CCR), retrieve_ccr, analyze_waste, batch_route. CavemanOutputPlugin: shape_system_prompt (verbosity steering L0-L4), remove_verbosity_steering, has_verbosity_steering, scan_volatile_tokens (UUID/JWT/timestamp/hash detection for KV-cache protection), has_volatile_tokens, optimize_for_cache. All existing plugins unchanged; additive release.",
